andromeda: the display reads iOS frames itself (andrscanout, default 0)

bsd/dev/andromeda_scanout.c (staged by 0207-stage-andromeda-scanout.sh) owns the
hardware; SweetFramebuffer.cpp gives the pipe each frame it can take and copies
the others as before. Design: data-a-live 0217-pandora-scanout (see
andromeda_scanout.h and CREDITS.md).

